oxy is frame.f_locals of a function's frame (PEP 667; Objects/frameobject.c's PyFrameLocalsProxy_Type):"] [268 1 "// a mapping over the frame itself, reads and writes going to its fast locals and cells, so a write is seen by the"] [269 1 "// frame's code at its next load (the loop's and the compiled code's loads read f.Fast and f.Cells, never a copy:"] [270 1 "// survey \"Design: 219\"); a name none of the code's goes to the frame's extra locals."] [273 1 "// FrameLocalsProxyType is the proxy's type (\"FrameLocalsProxy\", registered as a Mapping by _collections_abc)."] [278 1 "// frameSlot is one of a code's names in co_localsplusnames' order: the fast locals (a parameter that is a cell read"] [279 1 "// through its cell), then the cells that are no parameter, then the free variables."] [282 18 "// the index in f.Fast or f.Cells, -1 for the other"] [283 18 "// an earlier slot has the name (each)"] [319 1 "// slotValue is s's value in f, nil when unbound."] [348 1 "// slotOf is framelocalsproxy_getkeyindex: the slot of key's name, an exact str by its text, else any key by its hash"] [349 1 "// and ==; read: only a bound one. -1 when none."] [401 1 "// set is framelocalsproxy_setitem (v nil: del): a local's slot written, never removed; else the extra locals."] [433 1 "// each calls fn on the bound names and their values in order, then the extra locals'. A name twice among the slots"] [434 1 "// (an inlined comprehension's own name in a fast slot beside the function's cell of that name, while the comprehension"] [435 1 "// runs: GH-128396's case, one slot in CPython holding the plain value) gives its first bound slot's value."] [461 1 "// dict is the proxy's items as a new dict (PyDict_Update(dict, proxy))."] [473 1 "// merge is framelocalsproxy_merge: other a dict or a proxy, each of its keys set; false for another mapping."] [573 2 "// nb_or: either operand the proxy, the result a dict of the left's items, then the right's"] [719 1 "// cIntArg is a C int argument: an int, OverflowError beyond 32 bits."]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[12 23] [36 20] [64 25] [89 14] [89 24] [141 42] [156 28] [226 23] [229 25] [230 19] [230 29] [249 23] [250 25] [357 24] [367 22] [389 21] [390 26] [440 25] [442 14] [442 38] [450 19] [451 44] [476 39] [478 34] [483 26] [494 24] [507 35] [540 36] [547 31] [580 37] [587 25] [599 31] [606 41] [612 43] [620 42] [628 41] [634 49] [638 27] [638 34] [644 43] [689 40] [701 22] [702 26] [706 31]]} (go/file "tbobj.go" :imports [])

